---
// Ill04TwoOwners.astro
// Visual brief: The Two Owners — Legal Title vs Economic Benefit
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 04</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Two Owners: Trust Law Anatomy</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-navy-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 rounded font-medium">Bifurcated Title</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
      <div class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-navy-900 text-white dark:bg-navy-950 border border-slate-800 text-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">Underlying Security</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold">PORTFOLIO ASSET</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Split Branches -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Legal Branch -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-300 dark:border-navy-700 text-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Branch A</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Legal Title</h4>
        <div class="my-3 py-2 px-3 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
          TRUSTEE
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed m-0">
          Holds legal ownership, signs transactions, registered on record with custodians.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Economic Branch -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60 text-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Branch B</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Economic Benefit</h4>
        <div class="my-3 py-2 px-3 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/40">
          BENEFICIARY
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed m-0">
          Enjoys financial upside, absorbs economic loss, ultimate beneficiary of proceeds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Convergence -->
    <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-200/60 dark:bg-navy-950 border border-slate-300 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">The Income Tax Dilemma</div>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white m-0 mt-1">
        Who does the state assess? In what capacity? And at what rate?
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">The person holding the asset and the person entitled to its economics do not always have to be the same person.</p>
  </div>
</div>
